# The reason of this assignment is because the class name is updated from 'Vdu' to 'vdu'
# in order to keep consistency with the module name 'vdu'. But in current robot testcases,
# the usage of the lib is 'Library  taf.gnb.oam.coam.vdu.interface.Vdu    WITH NAME  vdu',
# to support this approach, the assignment is here.


Vdu = vdu
